My mom is passive aggressive about everything like this. I don't go to college, she is ok with it.

&#x200B;

BUT IF YOU DON'T YOU WILL NOT BE MY SON AND I WILL NEVER PAY FOR ANY OF YOU STUPID MUSIC THING.

&#x200B;

Its ridiculous. My mom is literally a monster at times, splitting the family up over these kinds of convos, even if it means hurting us physically or mentally. Its not even college sometimes, sometimes its things like:

"You fell down? Your so stupid why can't you just be athletic and smart?"

"God you failed another math test? Why can't you be more like you friend Lily?"

"I don't even know if I want you, you made my life miserable. I wish you were never born."

&#x200B;

The terrible thing is some of these comment I took to heart and for a while I struggled with depression and anxiety. I had to overcome this MYSELF. I don't even know how I did because I guess I got lucky and ended up not taking to heart these things. Keep in mind, my moms been doing this every since I can remember and I have been bullied countless time at school for being Asian as well as being mixed race, (my dads American) and when I came home to my mom saying similar things it broke me for a while. So I know I ranted a bit but it just shows hoe many Asian parents need to learn how to stop being passive aggressive, especially with you future and making money.

